  "text_md": "![](<f828606a3bb8b458fe49a4b6d79b3554961b_pg1_images/imageFile1.png>)\n\nCOLGATE-PALMOLIVE Company\n\nMATERIAL SAFETY DATA SHEET\n\n# AJAX CLEANER POWER-OXYGEN BLEACH\n\nThis industrial Material Safety Data Sheet is not intended for consumers and does not address consumer use of the product. For information regarding consumer applications of this product, refer to the product label.  \n\nVersion 1 . 1\n\nRevision Date 06/04/2010  \n\nPrint Date 06/04/2010\n\n# SECTION 1. PRODUCT AND COMPANY IDENTIFICATION\n\nProduct name\n\nMSDS Number\n\nCAS-No.\n\nGeneral Use\n\nAJAX CLEANER POWER-OXYGEN BLEACH 200000017621\n\nNot applicable product is a mixture\n\nA formulated multi-purpose cleaner.\n\nCompany\n\nTelephone  \n\nEmergency telephone\n\nMedical Emergency (24HR):\n\n(24HR):\n\nColgate-Palmolive Co Commerical Consumer Group 191 East Hanover Avenue Morristown, NJ 07960-3151\n\nFor emergency involving spill, leak, fire, exposure or accident, call CHEMTREC (800)424-9300, day or night. For MEDICAL EMERGENCIES involving this product call: (888) 489-3861\n\n(888) 489-3861\n\n# SECTION 2. HAZARDS IDENTIFICATION\n\n# Emergency Overview  \n\nForm\n\nAppearance  \n\n# Potential Health Effects  \n\nEye contact  \n\nSkin contact\n\nInhalation  \n\nIngestion  \n\nPowder    \n\nOff-white    \n\nCauses eye irritation on direct contact.\n\nMay cause skin irritation upon prolonged contact.\n\nNo adverse effects due to inhalation are expected.\n\nMay be harmful if swallowed in large quantities.\n\n# SECTION 3. COMPOSITION/INFORMATION ON INGREDIENTS\n\n# Hazardous components  \n\nOSHA-REGULATED COMPONENTS (present at a concentration of > or = 1%)\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th>Chemical Name</th>\n    <th>CAS-No.</th>\n    <th>Concentration *</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>LIMESTONE</td>\n    <td>1317-65-3</td>\n    <td>60.00 100.00</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>SODIUM CARBONATE SODIUM DODECYL</td>\n    <td>497-19-8</td>\n    <td>5.00 10.00</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>SODIUM DODECYL BENZENE SULFONATE</td>\n    <td>25155-30-0</td>\n    <td>1.00 5.00</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n\nAll concentrations are present by weight unless ingredient is a gas_ Gas concentrations are in percent by volume.\n\n",
